  "common": {
    "_comment": "Layout, accessibility and style, on everything this host draws. A capability does not repeat them and a renderer reads one set. The style props take a token — which is what makes an application look like it belongs on this phone — or a value of its own, because a Micro App is somebody's own product and the tokens are guidance rather than a fence.",
